                            <div class="lh-content"  data-lhi="content_items[0]con" data-lh-lang data-lh-live-editor data-lhis="content_items-con"><p><b><b><u>At Malik &amp; Compan</u></b>y</b>, we aim to deliver your packaging solutions promptly and reliably.</p><div><ul><li data-lh-list><u><i>Order Processing:</i></u> Orders are typically processed within 24 hours of confirmation.</li><li data-lh-list><i><u><b>Cash on Delivery (COD)</b></u></i>: All COD orders are verified via phone call or WhatsApp before dispatch.</li><li data-lh-list><i><u><b>Partial Shipments:</b></u></i> If any product is unavailable or fails quality checks, we may ship the rest of your order and inform you immediately of the adjustment.</li><li data-lh-list><b><i><u>Delivery Time:</u></i></b> Standard delivery within Pakistan takes 3–4 working days. During peak sales or high-volume periods, delivery times may extend.</li><li data-lh-list><b><i><u>Delivery Charges:</u></i></b> Shipping charges are applied as per standard courier rates.</li><li data-lh-list><b><i><u>For order updates or inquirie</u></i></b>s, please contact us at<i> sales@malikandcompany.pk</i> or call us at <i>+92 303 5050990.</i></li></ul></div></div>
                        </div>
                     <div class="lh-content-item">
                            <div class="lh-content-title"  data-lhi="content_items[1]title" data-lh-lang data-lhis="content_items-title">{{ 'o81qxagWnC.lh_2rtbys_title_html' | t }}</div>
                            <div class="lh-content"  data-lhi="content_items[1]con" data-lh-lang data-lh-live-editor data-lhis="content_items-con">At <b><i><u>Malik &amp; Company</u></i></b>, customer satisfaction is our priority. We offer easy exchanges for eligible products.&nbsp;<div><ul><li data-lh-list><i><u><b>Exchange Window:</b></u></i> Products may be exchanged within 3 days of delivery, provided they are unused, unopened, and in original packaging.</li><li data-lh-list><b><i><u>Damaged/Incorrect Products:</u></i></b> If your order arrives damaged, defective, incomplete, or incorrect, you must notify us within 7 days of delivery.</li><li data-lh-list><b><i><u>Customer Responsibility:</u></i></b> Customers are responsible for return shipping costs unless the product was delivered damaged, defective, or incorrect.</li><li data-lh-list><b><i><u>Proof of Condition:</u></i></b> For quality assurance, customers are advised to record a short video while unboxing their parcel.</li><li data-lh-list><b><i><u>Processing Time:</u></i></b> Return or exchange requests are processed within 15 working days.</li><li data-lh-list><i><u>Refunds</u></i>: At present, we do not offer refunds. Exchanges or replacements are provided instead.</li></ul></div></div>
